            {
                "entry_id": "db1ca83e-e7c3-3422-a3ad-cc08f17c2f09",
                "word": "étatiste",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f52dca87-937b-4b06-8289-3a2270268df8",
                        "entry_id": "db1ca83e-e7c3-3422-a3ad-cc08f17c2f09",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "étatistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40a0d382-ca86-3d37-8010-48770c27662e",
                        "entry_id": "db1ca83e-e7c3-3422-a3ad-cc08f17c2f09",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à l’étatisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97656ce7-70e9-4f9e-a17e-229dc5baa976",
                                "sense_id": "40a0d382-ca86-3d37-8010-48770c27662e",
                                "text": "Ces écrits sont de tous genres : les uns de théorie anarchiste, les autres de propagande, ou de polémique, ces derniers dirigés soit contre les communistes autoritaires et étatistes tels que Marx qui essayaient de faire prévaloir leurs idées dans l’Internationale, au moyen surtout d’abus de pouvoir, d’intrigues et de calomnies personnelles ; soit contre ceux qui préconisaient le parlementarisme et les candidatures ouvrières ; soit contre les idées mazziniennes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf2a2623-2daf-494c-a0c7-b9fc560b3f77",
                                "sense_id": "40a0d382-ca86-3d37-8010-48770c27662e",
                                "text": "L’État turc est républicain, nationaliste, populiste, étatiste, laïque et réformateur."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "422248c8-9430-4ac5-84fd-95aeb0ecf86e",
                        "source_entry_id": "db1ca83e-e7c3-3422-a3ad-cc08f17c2f09",
                        "source_sense_id": "40a0d382-ca86-3d37-8010-48770c27662e",
                        "target_lang_word": "statist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "statist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28a2b37c-a581-3a69-a027-45118065f5c6",
                                        "entry_id": "7147e760-eef5-38bf-b899-cbfd9fa1acfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A supporter of statism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "975d87fc-2087-34e2-93df-1570379bdfe2",
                                        "entry_id": "7147e760-eef5-38bf-b899-cbfd9fa1acfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statistician."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92287e75-1a52-3ff4-9e04-265381139dc5",
                                        "entry_id": "7147e760-eef5-38bf-b899-cbfd9fa1acfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A skilled politician or one with political power, knowledge or influence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6740fb9-6f4d-48bd-89b6-f83cda22814e",
                                                "sense_id": "92287e75-1a52-3ff4-9e04-265381139dc5",
                                                "text": "[O]ur Tympanouſe ſtatiſts / (In their affected grauitie of voice, / Sovverneſſe of countenance, maners crueltie, / Authoritie, vvealth, and all the ſpavvne of Fortune) / Thinke they beare all the kingdomes vvorth before them; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2923c0f0-8e1e-45fd-ac9f-76fd9d7462da",
                                                "sense_id": "92287e75-1a52-3ff4-9e04-265381139dc5",
                                                "text": "Statists and Politicians, unto whom Ragione di Stato is the first Considerable, as though it were their business to deceive the people, as a Maxim, do hold, that truth is to be concealed from them […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "statist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "661194ba-0262-3aba-8159-f46e5d899cf1",
                                        "entry_id": "1e738f37-80cb-3c19-b807-e120d1780a7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to statism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbd4b422-3938-411a-bb75-ea41fbc47022",
                                                "sense_id": "661194ba-0262-3aba-8159-f46e5d899cf1",
                                                "text": "It was as if the Samizdat spirit, extended and intensified by the proliferation of do-it-yourself media, had rendered the centralised, statist tyrannies of the Soviet Union untenable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebbe18fe-2d93-4bf8-aaf1-8a5bed3c3f79",
                                                "sense_id": "661194ba-0262-3aba-8159-f46e5d899cf1",
                                                "text": "By the early 1950s, however, the rising expectations for economic growth in the developing world were being dashed by the failure of foreign investment to materialize and by the declining terms of trade in these same raw materials, increasing the appeal of statist solutions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9508afc-4c0e-4cf6-9344-16df6c462598",
                                                "sense_id": "661194ba-0262-3aba-8159-f46e5d899cf1",
                                                "text": "Instead, he [Barack Obama] and [Gordon] Brown stand together, supposedly the representatives of Anglo-American turbocapitalism, struggling to push the statist French and Germans—and this is the bit that was in nobody's script—leftward."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a86d7a55-ebd1-43f8-a701-971c66a3fa1e",
                                                "sense_id": "661194ba-0262-3aba-8159-f46e5d899cf1",
                                                "text": "This is why the Conservative programme for government is founded on such a radical revolt against the statist approach of the Big Government that always knows best."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6c4d63a-595b-40ae-96c0-4182466366bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "db1ca83e-e7c3-3422-a3ad-cc08f17c2f09",
                        "source_sense_id": "40a0d382-ca86-3d37-8010-48770c27662e",
                        "target_lang_word": "pro-government",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
